                {
                  "text": "Sefa 2.8-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nelotu ororei lo Laitoriani enatii aajoki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enkerai e tung'ani, intorrioki enkomom ino enkalo oo Lamoni, imbonisho tigilunore ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiaaki Ilamoni: Entoning ororei lo Laitoriani Enkai: Ore amu itejo ‘Aha!’ Te nkaraki ewueji ai sinyati ina kata peyie eisarkionieki ninye, o te nkaraki ina kop e Israel ina kata peyie eitaa ninye mitil, o te nkaraki ina aji e Yuda ina kata peyie elo eyararoto; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neaku kaaitarasaa iyie aitarasaki iltung'ana le nkalo o loosaen peyie iaku entoki enye, naa keitasheyie ninche ilng'oborri lenye tiatua intae neitobiru imanyat enye tiatua intae; naa kenya ninche ilng'anayio linyi, neok ninche kule inyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaitaa Raba olokeri loo ntamesin ore nkanas oo Lamori emuatata oo ntare. Niyiolouu taa aajo ara nanu Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: ore amu itoosho inkaik inyi nioshieshie inkejek inyi enkop nishipapa te nkaraki intorrok pooki naatii atua intae te nkaraki enkop e Israel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "metaa, eng'ura, aitorioyie nanu enkaina ai aagilunore iyie naa kaaitarasaa iyie anaa iyarunot aitarasaki iloreren; naa kaadung'oo iyie aaitung'uaa loreren; naaisho iyie indaai too nkuapi; ekaaidaikie iyie. Pee itum iyie atayiolo ajo ara nanu Olaitoriani Enkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
