              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Sefa 2.8-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ore amu etejo Yuda, ing'ura ajo ore ina aji e Moab netiu anaa ilkulikae oreren pooki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neaku kaboloo inkanas oo lpolosien le Moab eiteru too nkanas naatii ilpolosien lenyena, o ina kop e Beteshimot o Baalmeon o Kiriatai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaishooyo ninye tenebo ile Amoni o metabaiki iltung'ana le nkalo o loo saen metaa enjung'ore, metaa meitokini aekata aadamu too loreren. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kadung'oki Moab enkiguana; ina peyie etum aatayiolo nchere ara nanu Olaitoriani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
