                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ore amu etaasa Edom entorrono aarare enkaji e Yuda, naaitagoro ninye aitalaku elap te ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa nji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai, ekaitorioo enkaina ai aarare Edom, nadung'oo tiatua ninye tung'ani o eng'ues; naa kaitaa ninye mitil; eiteru te Teman o metabaiki Dedan naa kebatata ninche to lalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kapik elap ai shumata Edom te nkaina oo ltung'ana laainei Isiraeli; naa keas ninche te Edom anaa enatiu engoro ai anaa enatiu engoro ai napi; naa keyiolou ninche elap ai, ejo Olaitoriani Enkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
